	(gr_text "POE_PRI_MOAT (placeholder zone, resize to enclose placed primary-side components):\nEnforces >=2.5mm copper clearance from POE_PRI-netclass copper to all other-net copper (.kicad_dru).\nPOE_PRI membership (2026-07-16, connectivity-derived, machine-verified by tools/check_netclasses.py\nin the pre-commit hook): POE_VA+/-, POE_VB+/-, and the /Power Input/ locals POE_VDD54, POE_VDD54_F,\nPOE_VSS, POE_RTN, N_AUX, N_AUX_R, N_BT, N_BTLED, N_CLAMP_D, N_CLAMP_G, N_CLSA, N_CLSB, N_COMP, N_CS,\nN_CS_SNS, N_DEN, N_DT, N_DTHR, N_FRS, N_GAT2, N_GATE, N_GATE_Q, N_ISTP, N_LINEUV, N_PPD, N_R43C44,\nN_REF, N_SST, N_SW, N_VB, N_VBG, N_VCC (+ U10 NC pads). POE_STS_RAW is SECONDARY (opto-isolated) and\ndeliberately excluded. Barrier parts T1/U20/U23/C19 carry courtyard-scoped exemptions in .kicad_dru\n(their internal creepage is governed by part safety rating, not board copper spacing); same-footprint\npad pairs elsewhere resolve to the 0.15mm JLCPCB pad-to-pad floor."
		(at 28.5 -11.25 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "4662d1b4-9ce4-43f6-b583-298ebe60c187")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
				(thickness 0.135)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "STACKUP: JLCPCB JLC7628 (JLC04161H-7628), 4L 1.6mm, L1 sig / In1 GND / In2 PWR / L4 sig.\nL1-In1 & In2-L4 dielectric: 7628 prepreg, 0.2104mm, Er=4.4 (Nan Ya NP-155F 7628, per\nJLCPCB-published stackup). Core In1-In2: 1.065mm FR-4, Er=4.43. Cu: L1/L4 1oz(0.035mm),\nIn1/In2 0.5oz(0.0152mm). Source: jlcpcb.com/impedance (JLC7628 4L 1.6mm) and the\nJLCPCB-derived KiCad stackup template jlcpcb_4L_1.6mm_outer1oz_inner0.5oz_JLC04161H-7628."
		(at -95 78 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "6cc5484c-b9d9-47aa-8579-153f5968c3ba")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "EP-VIA: hand-solder thermal-via pads to add under these exposed-pad parts during layout:\n  U2 (CH224K), U10 (TPS23730RMTR),\n  Q20 (FDMS86250), Q22/Q23 (BSC057N08NS3 x2, sync-rect FETs)\n  (U13/U14 INA226 corrected Task-15 import-fix: true VSSOP-10 DGS package\n  has no exposed pad -- MSOP-10_3x3mm_P0.5mm, EP-VIA removed)"
		(at -89.25 58.5 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "7052f15a-82bc-4f9f-9171-7c2ae078a9ae")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "IMPEDANCE GEOMETRIES (L1 top, referenced to In1 GND through 0.2104mm/Er4.4 prepreg).\nSOURCE: JLCPCB live impedance calculator, stackup JLC04161H-7628 (Standard, finished 1.59mm+/-10%),\n4L/1.6mm, outer 1oz / inner 0.5oz, verified 2026-07-16 (replaces Task-15 closed-form values;\nRF_50 closed form was wrong 2.4x -- see .kicad_dru header):\n  DIFF_USB_90  (USB2 SS/D+-):  W=0.2474mm  gap=0.15mm  -> Zdiff 90 ohm\n  DIFF_PCIE_85 (M.2 PCIe/REFCLK): W=0.2835mm gap=0.15mm -> Zdiff 85 ohm\n  DIFF_MDI_100 (Ethernet MDI): W=0.1826mm  gap=0.15mm  -> Zdiff 100 ohm\n  RF_50 (CPWG, ANT/GNSS):      W=0.3345mm  ground-gap=0.30mm -> Z0 50 ohm\n  Default (normal signals):    W=0.3586mm microstrip -> Z0 50 ohm (user-requested)\nCopper-to-other-net clearance floor for the 4 controlled classes: 0.30mm (see .kicad_dru).\nAlso entered in docs/ordering.md for the JLC order form (select JLC04161H-7628 + impedance control)."
		(at -84 92.75 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "8d6b7b5e-f4a7-4b53-b5ec-85268c84d47a")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
		)
	)
